<title>POLAND: Polish central bank sells PLN 456 mln of NBP-bills.</title>
<headline>Polish central bank sells PLN 456 mln of NBP-bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 92 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills and 364 million zlotys worth of 273-day paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the shorter bills fell by 0.01 point to 21.99 percent.</p>
<p>The bank sold 273-day NBP-bills at an unchanged average yield of 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
